From: Folia Compatibility Patch
Subject: [PATCH 0014] RepeatingTrigger: Migrate to Folia ScheduledTask with ConcurrentHashMap

AE PATCH REASON: HashMap is not thread-safe for region-thread access; BukkitRunnable/BukkitTask are incompatible with Folia.
AE PATCH FIX: Replace HashMap with ConcurrentHashMap for repeaters map. Replace BukkitRunnable/BukkitTask with Folia ScheduledTask. Migrate runTaskTimer() to entity.getScheduler().runAtFixedRate(). Remove @Generated lombok annotations. Add proper task cancellation tracking.
AE PATCH RISK: LOW

